WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.169
-James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.004
♪♪

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.439
Wow.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.508
♪♪

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.211
Very autumnal.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.646
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.115
♪♪

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.852
Thank you, ballot boxes, for
looking like regular mailboxes

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.287
that got buff during quarantine.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.056
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.495
♪♪

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:33.466
Thank you, pumpkin carving set,
for being the least used thing

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.735
in my utensil drawer,
right next to my bluetooth

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:40.740
meat thermometer.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.511
I promised I was going to
use that one.

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:46.979
Hmm.

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.314
♪♪

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:51.784
Thank you, Harley-Davidson,
making an electric bike

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.953
for being the most surprising
product release since

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.990
John Deer's line of
eco-friendly, organic eye cream.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.459
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.432
♪♪

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:11.236
Thank you, new Budlight
Peppermint Patty Hard Seltzer,

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:13.506
for being a good option for
people who are tired of

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.575
putting Listerine
in their soda stream.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:19.612
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.213
Oh, maybe I'll --

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:24.584
Don't knock it, all right?

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.018
♪♪

00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:29.322
Thank you, quails,
for being pigeons that do

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.124
makeup tutorials on YouTube.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.693
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:41.100
♪♪

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.504
Thank you, axe murderers,
for being the only type

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.706
of murderer that needs
a specialization.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.042
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.878
Jake here is an axe murderer.
Yeah.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.780
Kyle's more of a knife murderer.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.648
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:03.456
He's one of those gun murderers.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.425
We are down to our last one.
-Aww.

00:02:06.425 --> 00:02:08.628
-Sorry, folks, it just has to
happen, you know.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.862
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.697
[Southern accent ]
You know, what?

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:15.167
I'll get here
and I'll read my jokes.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:17.269
And I'll just, I want to
give you the best

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:18.671
thank you notes I possibly can.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.406
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:24.244
And that's why,
I had added this last one.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.246
Because we were only going to
do, was it nine?

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:29.282
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.817
But no, for you, especially.

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:33.686
Because you're the best
audience ever.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:37.623
You're the best crew ever.
And the best band ever.

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:40.726
One more thank you note!

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:44.730
Here we go. Here we go.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.266
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:48.968
[ Drum roll stops ]

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.402
♪♪

00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:53.072
Thank you,
full moon on Halloween,

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:55.107
for being definitely not
a bad omen

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.809
in the scariest year
of our lives.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:57.977
There you have it, everyone.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.813
Those are our thank you notes
right there.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.248
I appreciate it.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.784
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:08.087
Uh, guys, next week,
is election day,

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:10.389
but hundreds of thousands
of New Yorkers are already

00:03:10.389 --> 00:03:11.857
voting early this week.

00:03:11.857 --> 00:03:14.527
Now, the lines are long, some
people are waiting for hours.

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:16.663
And we wanted to thank voters
by doing something fun.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:20.633
So, earlier today, our buddies
over at Williamsburg Pizza,

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.735
and we handed out slices
to people in line.

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:26.739
Also, everyone got a "Tonight
Show" "I Voted" sticker.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:28.541
Because you got to get the
sticker, right?

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:30.810
yeah, but we thought we'd do one
better and give everyone

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.847
a "Tonight Show" "I'm Voting"
sticker, so they can wear that

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.817
while they wait
and then swap the stickers out.

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:40.820
Yeah, anyways,
let's check out how it went.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.621
More "Tonight Show"
after the break.

